000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002 PROGRAM-ID. FEECALC.
000003* Synthetic batch subprogram: account fee by customer type, size and lateness.
000004 DATA DIVISION.
000005 LINKAGE SECTION.
000006 01  LK-AMOUNT               PIC S9(7)V99.
000007 01  LK-CUST-TYPE            PIC X.
000008     88  CUST-PERSONAL       VALUE 'P'.
000009     88  CUST-BUSINESS       VALUE 'B'.
000010 01  LK-DAYS-LATE            PIC 9(3).
000011 01  LK-FEE                  PIC S9(7)V99.
000012 01  LK-REASON               PIC X(8).
000013 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-AMOUNT LK-CUST-TYPE LK-DAYS-LATE
000014                          LK-FEE LK-REASON.
000015 MAIN-PARA.
000016     MOVE 0 TO LK-FEE
000017     MOVE SPACES TO LK-REASON
000018     IF LK-AMOUNT <= 0
000019         MOVE 'NOAMOUNT' TO LK-REASON
000020         GOBACK
000021     END-IF
000022     EVALUATE TRUE
000023         WHEN CUST-PERSONAL
000024             COMPUTE LK-FEE = LK-AMOUNT * 0.015
000025         WHEN CUST-BUSINESS
000026             COMPUTE LK-FEE = LK-AMOUNT * 0.010
000027         WHEN OTHER
000028             MOVE 'BADTYPE' TO LK-REASON
000029             GOBACK
000030     END-EVALUATE
000031     IF LK-AMOUNT > 10000
000032         SUBTRACT 25 FROM LK-FEE
000033     END-IF
000034     IF LK-DAYS-LATE > 30
000035         ADD 40 TO LK-FEE
000036         MOVE 'LATE' TO LK-REASON
000037     END-IF
000038     IF LK-FEE < 2.50
000039         MOVE 2.50 TO LK-FEE
000040     END-IF
000041     GOBACK.
